-- Layout in plain words: a margin, a default text style, a heading style, things placed in, under and beside
-- other things, one label per swatch, readable colour, centred-by-eye icons and a table.
Let there be a flat canvas called layout, 1200 by 900.
Let the margin be 60.
Let text be in Jost, size 28, aligned left.
Let a heading be Martian Mono, size 22, tracking 6, #c19a4b.
Let bone be #efe6d8.
Let ink be #0b0b10.
Make the card ink.

Write "01  COLOUR" called h-colour as a heading, at the top left.
Let there be 4 rectangles called swatch, 160 by 200, corners 16, in a row, 180 apart, from 0 0, under the h-colour, 30 apart.
Make the first swatch #4a0e1c.
Make the second swatch bone.
Make the third swatch #0f3b2e.
Make the fourth swatch #c19a4b.
Write "Oxblood", "Bone", "Forest", "Brass" in each swatch, at the bottom left, 14 in.
Make the swatch-labels readable, bone or ink.

Let there be a circle called sticker, 90 big, at 1000 200.
Make the sticker #ff7a2f.
Write "NEW!" called new in Lilita One, size 48, aligned center, in the sticker.
Make the new ink.
Let there be a circle called play, 50 big, at 1000 420.
Make the play #1565c0.
Let there be a triangle called icon, 20 big, pointing right, in the play.
Make the icon white.
Write "Play" called side, beside the play, 20 apart.
Make the side bone.

Let there be a table called list, 1080 by 280, at 600 700, 5 rows, columns at 20, 70 and 1060 right, in Jost, size 24.
Make every other list-row #15161c.
Write "1", "Lanterns", "4:07" in the next row of the list.
Write "2", "Hollow", "3:52" in the next row of the list.
Write "3", "Ember Season", "5:10" in the next row of the list.
Make the list-words bone.
Make the third list-row #2a6fc4.
Make the third list-words white.
Make the list-column-3 #8a8f99.
Write "studiomorgana.xyz" called url at the bottom right.
Make the url #c19a4b.
